      "message": "David, the profit of placing osprofiler middleware here is to make profiling process easier for users. During the request passing through middleware, it will simply check if osprofiler is turned on of off. If it\u0027s turned off, request will be processed with our any modifications - and will have no impact on performance as well (except one \"if\" condition.)",
