      "message": "A-ha, went through the comments on #20 patch set. I believe it was meant to remove configurations (HMAC keys, enabled param) from the *.ini files - as previously osprofiler did not digest other forms of these params passing. Now it can do it due to https://github.com/openstack/osprofiler/commit/cabf79d44c77a9259481cabfa888e99730fb40b0 commit, so we can get rid of ugly parameters passing. Although this section is still 100% needed, as we\u0027re modifying the Keystone ini file, and all middleware need to be described here.\n\nCheers,\nDina",
